    * when it is an HDMI output without one or an HDMI output that is not there, or the one that was
    * followed to while no output has a display (see the definition).
    * \param followed the output that this setting was following before, empty when none
-   * \param missing set, when not null, to whether the driver of the configured output has no such
-   *        output in this start
+   * \param missing set, when not null, to whether the outputs listed in this start do not include
